  "stdout": "(node:95919) ExperimentalWarning: VM Modules is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n✔ final video data is committed before completed metadata and the stop reply (16.979542ms)\n✔ a refused video write preserves committed chunks and finalizes as partial with no live track (2.587875ms)\n✔ foreign extension and tab senders cannot start or stop the offscreen recorder (0.916375ms)\n✔ a second start is refused while the first media acquisition is still pending (2.364458ms)\n✔ unsupported encoding releases an acquired stream without inventing completed metadata (0.881667ms)\n✔ repeated stop requests share finalization and cannot duplicate its terminal receipt (1.211333ms)\n✔ a workflow JSON round trip preserves the ordered non-executable checklist (8.810375ms)\n✔ session processing projects workflow data without recovery or video metadata (0.500208ms)\n✔ validation leaves caller-owned objects unchanged and returns detached data (0.493917ms)\n✔ imports reject primitive and non-plain containers (1.291042ms)\n✔ unknown keys and recorded values are rejected at every workflow boundary (0.215417ms)\n✔ format and version never silently accept a foreign executable schema (0.08375ms)\n✔ missing required workflow and step keys are rejected (0.195833ms)\n✔ duplicate step identities cannot become two replay approvals (0.145458ms)\n✔ timestamps reject backward order and non-finite fractional or out-of-range values (0.241ms)\n✔ equal timestamps and the exact five-minute endpoint retain event order (0.260542ms)\n✔ the five-hundred-step boundary is accepted while the next step is refused (1.902834ms)\n✔ title label note selector and identity caps are enforced without truncation (1.839458ms)\n✔ multiline notes remain text while control characters cannot enter identity fields (0.139167ms)\n✔ unpaired Unicode surrogates are rejected instead of silently changing exported data (0.131958ms)\n✔ target records are exact data and manual steps can omit an executable target (0.155417ms)\n✔ field tasks exclude credential hidden file and submit-like controls (0.150875ms)\n✔ imported sources must already be canonical and cannot hide a query or fragment (0.099541ms)\n✔ recording a source strips private URL query and fragment values (0.049625ms)\n✔ source capture refuses credentials and non-web protocols (0.307208ms)\n✔ Markdown renders hostile HTML and link syntax as text without private session data (0.358083ms)\n✔ analysis counts event kinds and reports the recorded stopped duration (0.088625ms)\n✔ recording finalization retains observed duration beyond the bounded action timeline (0.075334ms)\n✔ active or interrupted analysis uses the last recorded event without a running clock (0.149291ms)\n✔ an empty checklist remains a valid reviewable workflow rather than an automatic action (0.076292ms)\n✔ prototype keys and accessor input are refused without invoking supplied code (0.144583ms)\nℹ tests 31\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 31\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 95.337583\n",
